%%{init: {"theme": "default"}}%%
flowchart TD
    A[InitialAnalysisAgent] -->|classification / risk_score| Route{Route Decision}
    Route -->|Safe| Passthrough[Passthrough]
    Route -->|Risky| Rewrite[SafePromptAgent]
    Route -->|Blocked or risk ≥ 0.85| Block[Block Node]
    Passthrough --> LLM[LLM Call]
    Rewrite --> LLM
    LLM --> Verify[ResponseVerifierAgent]
    Verify -->|needs evidence?| Search[WebSearchAgent]
    Search --> Verify
    Verify -->|may run| CodeValidate[CodeValidationAgent]
    Verify --> Audit[AuditChainAgent]
    Block --> Audit
    Audit --> End((END))
graph TD
    A[InitialAnalysisAgent] -->|classification| B{Route}
    B -->|Safe| P[Passthrough]
    B -->|Risky| R[SafePromptAgent]
    B -->|Blocked or risk ≥ 0.85| BLK[Block Node]
    P --> L[LLM Call]
    R --> L
    BLK --> AU[Audit]
    L --> V[Verify]
    V --> AU
    AU --> END((END))
